<title>POLAND: Gdanski Q2 net rises to PLN 33.7 mln.</title>
<headline>Gdanski Q2 net rises to PLN 33.7 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Gdanski preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997     Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		    47.50    vs  31.71</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			47.49    vs  31.73</p>
<p>    net profit			    33.75    vs  19.91</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Bank Gdanski SA.</p>
<p>    revenues from securities	   2.86    vs   1.13</p>
<p>    interest and similar revenues  218.82    vs 182.65</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    interest and similar costs     135.98    vs 107.86</p>
<p>    revenues from commission	  22.78    vs  17.88</p>
<p>    costs of commission		  1.85    vs   1.13</p>
<p>    income tax			    13.75    vs  11.82</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.00    vs   0.00</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		   0.01    vs   0.02 profit</p>
<p>						H1 1997     H1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		    89.95    vs  89.55</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			89.96    vs  89.58</p>
<p>    net profit			    59.96    vs  55.34</p>
<p>    revenues from securities	   2.86    vs   1.13</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    interest and similar revenues  424.15    vs 361.35</p>
<p>    interest and similar costs     256.09    vs 212.35</p>
<p>    revenues from commission	  46.35    vs  37.03</p>
<p>    costs of commission		  3.78    vs   2.05</p>
<p>    income tax			    30.01    vs  34.23</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.00    vs   0.00</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		 0.01    vs   0.02</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
